ing for Music","confidence":"medium","mapping_status":"reviewed_against_local_tree"}],"mapping_gap":null}],"agent_notes":["The official HTE search endpoint maps the institution's full-name variant to page 10917, whose homepage identifies it as S.D. Government College, Beawar; the official Department of College Education directory independently lists SANATAN DHARM GOVT. COLLEGE in BEAWER.","The verified institution homepage and contact page confirm the Beawar campus and address. The institution pages do not state a district, so district remains null pending a direct official district statement.","The UG catalogue at /10965 lists B.Sc., B.A., B.Com., and B.A. (Hons.) with the exact page labels and subject options. The PG catalogue at /10970 lists the thirteen postgraduate programme labels returned above and explicitly states a two-year postgraduate course duration.","The M Phil page (/10971) and Ph D page (/10972) contain only category/banner headings and no active programme or discipline listing, so they were not guessed into the course array; this makes the official catalogue partial and requires manual review.","The homepage carousel labels the music programme as M.A.(Music)(Vocal)SFS, while the PG catalogue labels it M. A. Music (Self Finance). The PG catalogue label was retained and the discrepancy is recorded here.","The managed network proxy produced the exact local self-signed certificate-chain error on the first Google request; curl --insecure was used only for public requests to the expected search and official Rajasthan HTE hostnames.","All career mappings were checked with read-only sqlite3 queries against assets/data/career_path.db; the database was not edited."]}